{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06976","headline":"题江潮庄壁 · 万楚","name":"题江潮庄壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田家喜秋熟，岁[晏]林叶稀。\n禾黍积场圃，𣙁梨垂户扉\n野闲犬时吠，日暮牛自归。\n时复落花酒，茅斋堪解衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"万楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}